WEBVTT

00:19.820 --> 00:24.158
The wound inside
my sealed memories

00:24.158 --> 00:28.796
When it silently touches the heart

00:28.796 --> 00:36.503
Tears of loneliness behind
the gentle smile

00:36.503 --> 00:41.308
I seek boundless strength

00:41.308 --> 00:52.119
I continue to run up with
what I believe in

00:52.119 --> 00:54.121
I want to protect

00:54.121 --> 00:56.490
I want to believe

00:56.490 --> 01:00.794
all the reasons for that smile

01:00.794 --> 01:05.165
The heat and the love

01:05.165 --> 01:09.403
I accept them all

01:09.403 --> 01:13.040
I won't let go of your hand again

01:13.040 --> 01:21.641
Aiming towards that light...

01:31.925 --> 01:35.622
Previously on Shonen Onmyouji...

01:37.564 --> 01:41.502
You couldn't even defeat
an old man? That's pathetic!

01:41.502 --> 01:44.038
Please accept my apologies,
Master!

01:44.038 --> 01:46.373
Not only did you
let him escape,

01:46.373 --> 01:48.542
you've awoken an
unneeded spirit too...

01:48.542 --> 01:50.510
when you summoned
the vengeful ghost.

01:50.644 --> 01:53.347
The future is going
to be so exciting...

01:53.347 --> 01:55.449
that I won't have time
to get bored!

01:55.449 --> 01:56.040
What?

01:56.550 --> 01:59.920
- Evil! You are evil!
- No way!

01:59.920 --> 02:02.912
Return to your place of origin.

02:10.431 --> 02:13.634
The spirit has gone deep
into your body.

02:13.634 --> 02:16.194
So the border guard from
yesterday possesses me?

02:16.637 --> 02:20.674
This demonic mass is a result of
the disruption in the netherworld.

02:20.674 --> 02:22.643
Other than the guard's spirit,

02:22.643 --> 02:24.770
such a monster has been
summoned too?!

02:26.613 --> 02:29.844
Sleep in the Caress of
the Six Petals

02:35.589 --> 02:39.193
Please go, and take
care of yourself.

02:39.193 --> 02:41.328
Don't worry about us.

02:41.328 --> 02:45.628
We'll be waiting,
so come back safely.

02:51.371 --> 02:53.271
Oh, you're awake.

02:53.440 --> 02:55.008
Did I?

02:55.008 --> 02:57.144
They said you suddenly
collapsed.

02:57.144 --> 02:59.546
Rikugou carried you
back home.

02:59.546 --> 03:02.777
He said you were fine,
just a little stressed.

03:05.119 --> 03:07.144
You had that dream again?

03:08.655 --> 03:12.359
It was snowing...
And when I saw the snow,

03:12.359 --> 03:15.556
there was this sense of
indescribable sadness...

03:16.130 --> 03:19.861
- Masahiro!
- My condition's deteriorating.

03:20.100 --> 03:23.797
I'll be in deep trouble if
I can't deliver his soul soon.

03:25.973 --> 03:26.997
Where's Mokkun?

03:29.243 --> 03:32.303
You are as reckless as ever.

03:33.180 --> 03:36.115
It's not like you to be silent.

03:36.884 --> 03:40.787
Could you possibly be regretting
the reckless things you did...

03:40.787 --> 03:43.257
when you saved
Masahiro's life earlier?

03:43.257 --> 03:45.058
That's all you wanted to say?

03:45.058 --> 03:50.364
I heard that Takaokami no Kami said
some weird things the other day.

03:50.364 --> 03:53.333
I am a little concerned
by them.

03:53.333 --> 03:55.927
So I sent Rikugou to Kifune.

03:58.539 --> 04:03.043
He said that a weird spiritual
aura was lingering...

04:03.043 --> 04:07.247
near the spiritual barrier
surrounding Kifune mountain.

04:07.247 --> 04:08.782
A weird aura?

04:08.782 --> 04:11.818
This aura seems to be
the same as that of...

04:11.818 --> 04:15.155
the guardsman who's
possessing Masahiro now.

04:15.155 --> 04:16.623
What?!

04:16.623 --> 04:20.327
Moreover, the scent
of minor demons and...

04:20.327 --> 04:24.398
the aura of Takaokami no Kami
were there too.

04:24.398 --> 04:25.866
What does that mean?

04:25.866 --> 04:28.926
According to Rikugou's polite
enquiries at the temple...

04:30.103 --> 04:34.541
A wandering spirit turned up
at my residence one day.

04:34.541 --> 04:36.977
He kept crying,
so I told him that...

04:36.977 --> 04:39.746
someone on the other side
of the capital...

04:39.746 --> 04:41.515
might be able to help him.

04:41.515 --> 04:44.251
Say, minor demons
were here too and...

04:44.251 --> 04:47.554
they seemed to be
following that spirit.

04:47.554 --> 04:52.787
So Takaokami no Kami is the one
to blame for all these incidents!

04:54.394 --> 04:58.865
Takaokami no Kami has been
pushing her problems to you!

04:58.865 --> 05:00.801
But... why me?

05:00.801 --> 05:02.836
Knowing her...

05:02.836 --> 05:05.205
She's making use of
your kindness...

05:05.205 --> 05:08.231
expecting you to somehow
handle the problems!

05:08.842 --> 05:10.944
Mokkun, get a grip!

05:10.944 --> 05:13.242
Masahiro! We're going
to Kifune now!

05:14.581 --> 05:17.484
We'll give Takaokami no Kami
a piece of our minds!

05:17.484 --> 05:18.518
Okay.

05:18.518 --> 05:21.146
I'll go get Kurumanosuke.

05:22.522 --> 05:24.752
So you're going to Kifune now?

05:25.359 --> 05:28.729
It's probably easier if I ask
the Takaokami no Kami...

05:28.729 --> 05:31.531
to help me exorcise
the guardsman's spirit.

05:31.531 --> 05:35.102
If so, you'd better put on
more warm clothing.

05:35.102 --> 05:39.506
It snows pretty heavily in Kifune
around this time of the year.

05:39.506 --> 05:41.167
You're right.

05:41.508 --> 05:45.412
Wrap this around your arms
and legs to keep warm.

05:45.412 --> 05:47.114
Thank you.

05:47.114 --> 05:50.517
Take care, and please
come back soon.

05:50.517 --> 05:52.280
Do you promise?

05:57.658 --> 06:00.160
- That Takaokami no Kami!
- Mokkun.

06:00.160 --> 06:03.430
- She's a deity.
- Who cares?

06:03.430 --> 06:05.499
But I'll be cursed if
something goes wrong!

06:05.499 --> 06:06.989
Big deal.

06:09.002 --> 06:10.304
What?

06:10.304 --> 06:13.330
Well, it's your usual self.

06:17.644 --> 06:19.874
The bloodstained shikigami,
Touda!

06:23.350 --> 06:27.120
If he can't read the guardsman's
heart accurately,

06:27.120 --> 06:29.723
the exorcism of the spirit
can't be done.

06:29.723 --> 06:32.626
I wonder if Masahiro
can handle it.

06:32.626 --> 06:35.288
But he'll try anyway.

06:36.897 --> 06:40.434
I'm afraid it's beyond
his ability this time.

06:40.434 --> 06:44.638
I don't know why, but somehow
I feel very uneasy about this.

06:44.638 --> 06:46.273
In a word...

06:46.273 --> 06:49.009
you're suggesting us
to head to Kifune too.

06:49.009 --> 06:51.375
- If that's the case.
- Okay!

06:52.512 --> 06:54.815
Kifune is known as
a holy mountain.

06:54.815 --> 06:56.550
The snow is deep.

06:56.550 --> 07:00.316
I'm glad Akiko made me
wear some warm clothing.

07:00.921 --> 07:02.786
Hey, there!

07:05.826 --> 07:09.062
Why? Kifune's supposed to be
protected by the spiritual barrier!

07:09.062 --> 07:10.859
Masahiro!

07:18.305 --> 07:19.795
What?

07:26.747 --> 07:29.079
Their bodies... have combined!

07:30.083 --> 07:31.675
It's coming!

07:37.491 --> 07:39.626
Deity of the eastern sea,
deity of the western sea.

07:39.626 --> 07:41.595
Deity of the southern sea,
deity of the northern sea.

07:41.595 --> 07:43.797
Rulers of the four seas,
slay the thousand ghosts.

07:43.797 --> 07:47.756
Banish all ill fortune.
Do it now!

07:53.306 --> 07:56.276
Both my spells and
Guren's fire didn't work!

07:56.276 --> 07:59.677
Devouring its own kind must have
increased its strength.

08:13.960 --> 08:16.588
Seems like it's about
to snow.

08:18.131 --> 08:20.066
- Oh no.
- What's wrong?

08:20.066 --> 08:22.035
The spiritual barrier is broken.

08:22.035 --> 08:23.798
Seimei! Look!

08:26.840 --> 08:29.866
It's slimy! So disgusting!

08:36.283 --> 08:39.411
Get away from us!

08:42.055 --> 08:45.592
- Rikugou, what's wrong?
- Someone's inside that thing.

08:45.592 --> 08:47.150
What?

08:55.802 --> 08:57.269
What?!

09:01.708 --> 09:03.369
Masahiro!

09:06.112 --> 09:08.046
I won't let you!

09:14.321 --> 09:15.845
Guren!

09:17.357 --> 09:19.086
Masahiro!

09:22.095 --> 09:23.528
Guren!

09:24.965 --> 09:27.365
Darn you...

09:40.647 --> 09:42.638
Masahiro!

09:57.597 --> 10:00.532
Stay away from Seimei!

10:02.469 --> 10:06.106
Right, I can feel a different
spiritual energy in there.

10:06.106 --> 10:08.875
And still alive in that thing?!

10:08.875 --> 10:12.072
- Is that possible?!
- Could it be?

10:14.014 --> 10:15.606
Genbu!

10:21.755 --> 10:24.558
Bind, hold and constrict.
Bonds of immobility.

10:24.558 --> 10:26.526
Deities, descend now!

10:38.905 --> 10:42.602
I can't believe it!
What are you doing, Rikugou?

10:46.880 --> 10:50.577
As I thought, it was Kazane.
How is she?

10:53.687 --> 10:55.288
Incredible.

10:55.288 --> 10:58.525
How could she survive inside
the minor demons?

10:58.525 --> 11:01.585
Most of her spiritual energy's
been absorbed by it.

11:04.965 --> 11:07.866
What should we do now, Seimei?

11:08.668 --> 11:10.704
If we help her recover,

11:10.704 --> 11:13.974
she might attempt to
kill Seimei again.

11:13.974 --> 11:18.206
But we can't possibly
abandon her like this.

11:50.877 --> 11:52.276
You...

11:54.381 --> 11:58.044
Don't you ransack my
dwelling anymore?

12:01.187 --> 12:03.523
Don't mess with me,
Takaokami no Kami!

12:03.523 --> 12:05.291
I must save Masahiro,

12:05.291 --> 12:07.594
even if I have to engulf
this mountain in flames!

12:07.594 --> 12:09.425
That's nonsense.

12:16.069 --> 12:19.639
I've descended to the ground
in a different form like this...

12:19.639 --> 12:23.476
- Don't raise your voice.
- Just don't get in my way.

12:23.476 --> 12:26.546
Has he become that weak?

12:26.546 --> 12:27.847
What's that?

12:27.847 --> 12:29.549
In that case,

12:29.549 --> 12:33.453
it'd probably be best if
he perished right now.

12:33.453 --> 12:35.444
You wretch!

12:46.833 --> 12:48.562
Where am I?

12:51.638 --> 12:54.274
I must find a way
out of here!

12:54.274 --> 12:56.742
Hopefully this spell will help...

12:57.243 --> 13:00.440
I can't... breathe...

13:01.314 --> 13:03.416
I can't...

13:03.416 --> 13:06.252
end up... here!

13:06.252 --> 13:10.712
I can't... be defeated...

13:20.333 --> 13:22.435
They're like flowers,
aren't they?

13:22.435 --> 13:25.370
White flowers with six petals.

13:32.078 --> 13:35.815
Don't forget.
We'll be waiting here.

13:35.815 --> 13:40.149
In this village that Six Petals
fall on, we'll always be here.

13:43.890 --> 13:45.653
Why?

13:47.127 --> 13:49.618
Why are you so sad?

13:50.430 --> 13:53.466
Because... I'll never
see them again.

13:53.466 --> 13:55.866
Why is it so painful?

13:56.503 --> 13:58.471
No matter how hard I pray,

13:59.105 --> 14:01.374
my wish will never
be fulfilled.

14:01.374 --> 14:05.140
Then... what are you
suffering from?

14:07.480 --> 14:11.382
We promised each other,
but I...

14:13.453 --> 14:17.287
Don't worry about us.
We'll be waiting here for you.

14:18.358 --> 14:20.622
Please come home safe.

14:25.732 --> 14:27.825
You wanted to go home.

14:28.635 --> 14:31.126
And that's the reason
your spirit is troubled.

14:32.906 --> 14:34.874
I'm the same.

14:36.543 --> 14:39.078
You don't have to be
so sad anymore...

14:39.078 --> 14:41.979
because you'll see them again.

14:45.318 --> 14:47.854
All your suffering will
come to an end.

14:47.854 --> 14:51.449
Your wish will come true
when you pray hard.

15:08.942 --> 15:12.503
You made a promise to her
that you'd return.

15:13.313 --> 15:15.042
Darling!

15:22.021 --> 15:25.457
- Welcome home.
- I'm back.

15:34.234 --> 15:37.101
I've used up too much
of my power.

15:37.570 --> 15:41.097
Please come back soon.
Do you promise?

15:41.941 --> 15:43.499
Akiko...

15:47.247 --> 15:51.351
Supreme spell,
defeat the darkest evil.

15:51.351 --> 15:54.650
All calamities... disperse now!

15:55.889 --> 15:57.322
What?

16:10.536 --> 16:13.573
Masahiro, are you all right?

16:13.573 --> 16:15.473
Hey, Masahiro!

16:18.745 --> 16:23.011
Masahiro, open your eyes!
Masahiro!

16:26.152 --> 16:29.553
I won't let you...
in a place like this!

16:30.089 --> 16:33.526
Open your eyes! Masahiro!

16:33.526 --> 16:38.589
You... Seimei's... grandson!

16:48.708 --> 16:51.210
Don't say... grandson!

16:51.210 --> 16:54.043
Anything but grandson!

16:55.548 --> 16:57.243
Masahiro...

16:58.351 --> 17:01.787
Guren, I was so worried
about you.

17:03.523 --> 17:08.426
I don't know what had happened
to you in the past...

17:08.828 --> 17:11.262
I can't be there for you
unless you tell me.

17:12.332 --> 17:14.698
What are you hiding
from me?

17:16.369 --> 17:21.074
It's like you, Mokkun.
I'd worry about you!

17:21.074 --> 17:24.009
I'm not Mokkun.
I'm Guren now.

17:44.397 --> 17:46.297
Where am I?

17:48.701 --> 17:51.295
I remember... then...

17:53.306 --> 17:55.604
This can't be happening!

17:58.277 --> 18:01.337
I was... But why?

18:05.618 --> 18:09.489
Master... you saved my life,
didn't you?

18:09.489 --> 18:11.821
You useless imbecile!

18:12.358 --> 18:15.328
Please forgive me, Master.

18:15.328 --> 18:17.530
You aren't injured.

18:17.530 --> 18:21.330
No, I'm all right. I apologize
for making you worry.

18:21.768 --> 18:23.531
Let's go.

18:26.706 --> 18:28.571
This aura...

18:32.278 --> 18:33.973
Mokkun.

18:34.881 --> 18:36.716
A long time ago,

18:36.716 --> 18:40.777
even before Yoshimasa
was born...

18:41.454 --> 18:44.290
Shikigami is forbidden
to hurt humans...

18:44.290 --> 18:48.454
or kill humans. However, I...

18:49.362 --> 18:53.093
I almost killed Seimei.

18:54.500 --> 18:59.631
My master, who gave me
the name Guren...

19:00.239 --> 19:03.697
I almost took his life
with my own hands.

19:04.877 --> 19:07.080
- And then...
- That's enough.

19:07.080 --> 19:08.775
Really...

19:10.950 --> 19:13.282
It's okay. Let's stop.

19:15.421 --> 19:17.490
Grandfather is still alive.

19:17.490 --> 19:23.122
So you don't have to
suffer anymore.

19:43.282 --> 19:46.342
He is promising.

19:48.521 --> 19:50.490
He is interesting.

19:50.490 --> 19:53.626
I'll take notice of him
as long as he is fascinating.

19:53.626 --> 19:56.329
Let's see if his new gentle
nature will last.

19:56.329 --> 19:58.559
Or if it is just a front.

19:59.632 --> 20:02.034
Takaokami no Kami.

20:02.034 --> 20:07.106
Say, I will allow you to call me
Takao when I'm in this form.

20:07.106 --> 20:11.444
I'm truly honored,
Takao no Kami.

20:11.444 --> 20:14.208
Make sure he knows of
my name too.

20:29.195 --> 20:31.597
Aki... ko...

20:31.597 --> 20:33.232
You should be fine now.

20:33.232 --> 20:35.598
Tenitsu healed you earlier.

20:37.503 --> 20:39.232
What's the matter?

20:41.541 --> 20:43.406
Mokkun...

20:43.743 --> 20:46.712
- Masahiro, are you awake?
- Oh?

20:46.712 --> 20:49.048
Nice to meet you.

20:49.048 --> 20:51.651
I am Taiin,
one of the shikigami.

20:51.651 --> 20:54.387
Feel free to call on me
when you need some wind!

20:54.387 --> 20:55.688
Better not...

20:55.688 --> 20:58.524
Taiin's wind is pretty rough.

20:58.524 --> 21:01.427
What? Come again!

21:01.427 --> 21:03.361
Hey, keep it down!

21:04.263 --> 21:06.132
Masahiro's trying to rest here!

21:06.132 --> 21:08.734
- Be more considerate!
- But we...

21:08.734 --> 21:11.604
And that's not all!
Your behavior is...

21:11.604 --> 21:13.739
A-And what's so funny?

21:13.739 --> 21:16.401
You're back to your
long-winded old self!

21:21.547 --> 21:23.310
Akiko.

21:25.017 --> 21:26.814
I'm home.

21:27.987 --> 21:29.579
Welcome back.

21:42.969 --> 21:54.447
Everyone, as time passes,
loses sight of his dreams

21:54.447 --> 22:05.758
Errors and pains are repeated
through the ages

22:05.758 --> 22:11.497
Why do we resist believing
in each other?

22:11.497 --> 22:17.094
Why do we put out
the light of fate?

22:19.305 --> 22:29.615
I want to protect our future
with this hand

22:29.615 --> 22:36.422
Because you taught me

22:36.422 --> 22:41.627
What it means to challenge
with all my strength

22:41.627 --> 22:47.466
You will keep overcoming
your limits

22:47.466 --> 22:54.565
Surely surely surely

22:59.745 --> 23:02.612
Next Episode

23:23.402 --> 23:25.071
Next on Shonen Onmyouji...

23:25.071 --> 23:26.572
Episode 18.

23:26.572 --> 23:26.872
Nobody Knows That Reason.

23:26.872 --> 23:29.170
Episode 18
Nobody Knows That Reason
Nobody Knows That Reason.
